    title: "generate-schema and regenerate-backend-agreement-table write files in their own tree but import hypergumbo from whatever the interpreter resolves (generate-schema's sys.path pin names a REPO_ROOT/src that no longer exists)"  # 3dc2
    status: todo_hard  # 3dc2
    priority: 3  # 3dc2
