  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at 100b6fbb6e: generate-schema:27-29 still inserts REPO_ROOT/src (which does not exist), and regenerate-backend-agreement-table:51 imports hypergumbo_core.cli unpinned. A probe copying the pin into a fake tree that has its own packages/hypergumbo-core/src, with PYTHONPATH unset, imported hypergumbo_core from /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo/packages/... Also, .githooks/pre-commit:216 runs generate-schema --check, so worktree commits are checked against main-checkout code. MECHANISM: script writes its own tree's files but resolves code via the interpreter path; self-pin points at a nonexistent REPO_ROOT/src. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-tumog."  # b87c
